      <h2>About Mrembo Spa &amp; Traditional Services</h2>
      <p>Mrembo Spa in Stone Town offers authentic Swahili wellness traditions using locally sourced ingredients — clove oil from Pemba, coconut from coastal groves, seaweed from Jambiani farms, and henna from Zanzibari gardens. Services include traditional Swahili massage with warm herbal oils, bridal henna artistry, coconut body scrubs, and bridal preparation ceremonies. Located in a restored historic building, the spa provides a cultural wellness journey connecting visitors to Zanzibar&#x27;s centuries-old healing traditions.</p>

